<section id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Validator.</h4>

<div id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The validator labels each atom of the current rule <span id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">YES</span>/<span id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">NO</span> for a given object.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p2" class="ltx_para">
