<section id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Auditor.</h4>

<div id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The auditor checks the value of each predicate and updates new ones into the vocabulary.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px3.p2" class="ltx_para">
