<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>The 20 most frequent physical-property questions across all evaluation games, with their targeted dimension and count (percentage of the 373,060 yes/no turns).</figcaption>
