</figure>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Success Rate Breakdown</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We report the top-5 easiest and bottom-5 hardest affordances for three model groups: 1) All 15 LLMs (<a href="#A3.T4" title="In Appendix C Success Rate Breakdown ‣ Affordance20Q: Evaluating Affordance Reasoning from Physical Properties" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>), 2) Open-source LLMs (<a href="#A3.T5" title="In Appendix C Success Rate Breakdown ‣ Affordance20Q: Evaluating Affordance Reasoning from Physical Properties" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>), and 3) Closed-source LLMs (<a href="#A3.T6" title="In Appendix C Success Rate Breakdown ‣ Affordance20Q: Evaluating Affordance Reasoning from Physical Properties" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>).</p>
</div>
